<title>RUSSIA: Russian average wage falls 15 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Russian average wage falls 15 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian average wages fell 15 percent in January to 870,000 roubles, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN AVERAGE WAGES	JAN 97	DEC 96	JAN 96</p>
<p>    average wage		  870,000   1,017,000     655,000</p>
<p>    subsistence income	  394,000     379,000     345,000</p>
<p>NOTES - Average wage and subsistence wage in roubles. In January, 22 percent of the population or 31.9 million people were receiving less than subsistence income.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
